A note on the upstream licence, recorded rather than glossed over.

AF Flow is a fork of Ghost Pepper (https://github.com/matthartman/ghost-pepper).
That project's README declares the MIT licence, in a badge and in a "License"
section, and this fork relies on that declaration. As of 2026-08-25 the upstream
repository does not actually contain a LICENSE file: the badge links to one and
the link returns 404. The copyright line above for the upstream work is
therefore attributed from the repository owner, not copied from an upstream
notice, because no upstream notice exists to copy.
